  {"claim": "The shield steps aside for his own cut, up to about half a metre; 59 cm at most in the fight of six. For that moment it is not before his chest.", "from": RUNS + "; " + DOC + ". This is the cost."},
  {"claim": "Why it went through: each arm posed alone; the shield held before his chest through his own blows, its rim a hand's breadth past his breastbone on the sword's side; nothing looked at the pair.", "from": DOC + ". The top views are sketches of the idea, not measurements."},
  {"claim": "The rule: forearm and blade, as posed and as seen; a blade stopped on the other's shield was up to 57 cm from its pose.", "from": RUNS + "; " + DOC + "."},
  {"claim": "The rule: the path over the next 0.3 s at the present speed; no look ahead for a sword at rest; the least of sixteen ways that leaves a 6 cm lane; outward and down preferred; back over a quarter of a second; followed smoothly; his body's guard and collision come after and win.", "from": DOC + ". Built, behind a switch."},
  {"claim": "Aim test: blade 1.30 s to 0.25 s; sword arm 1.00 s to 0.10 s; crossings of a twentieth of a second or more 13 to 5; blows meeting the other's shield 16 off, 14 on.", "from": RUNS + ", the same build, rule off then on."},
  {"claim": "Fight of six from another start: blade and sword arm through his own shield 2.4 s to 0.2 s.", "from": RUNS + ", the same build, rule off then on."},
  {"claim": "Main fight of six, rule on, both bearers on their feet for 40 s: blade 0.13 s, sword arm 0.07 s, shield in his own body 0.07 s; 0.3 s of 80; this morning's game 4.0 s.", "from": RUNS + "."},
  {"claim": "His playtest: about 190 s of two sword and shield fighters, the build before the shield gave way; shield in his own body 7 times, 2 on his feet (36 at 16:41); blade through his own shield 18 times, sword arm 15, 13 of those in his own blows.", "from": PLAY + "."},
